```

<img width="842" alt="Screen Shot 2022-10-20 at 9 37 08 PM" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/906558/197090865-65f0caa7-78f8-4ab8-b62f-24b5f067bfb8.png">

A copy of the repro is available here: https://github.com/gluxon/yargs-truncation-repro

## Logging for `setBlocking`

I was a bit surprised by this result. It turns out the reason for this is because the the `setBlocking` call within `yargs` doesn't happen until after the error is thrown.

I added an additional log line here:

